  "term": "PANAS",
  "definition": "PANAS stands for Positive and Negative Affect Schedule, a widely used measure of positive and negative emotional states. It is used to assess feelings such as enthusiasm and enjoyment alongside emotions like anxiety, tension, frustration, and fatigue.",
